# The droplet deployment (and local dev) talks to Postgres directly.
DATABASE_URL=postgres://defense:defense@localhost:5433/defense

# Vercel ONLY. Leave this unset everywhere else.
#
# It is inlined at build time and tells lib/api.ts where the API lives. Unset,
# every call is a same-origin relative path, which is what the droplet image and
# `next dev` both need. Set, the pages and the browser call the droplet instead
# — which is the whole point of the Vercel deployment, since defense-db is not
# reachable from Vercel and never will be.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DEFENSE_API_URL=https://defense-api.aza.systems

# Read by proxy.ts on the droplet to allow the Vercel origin through CORS.
# Comma-separated; defaults to https://defense.aza.systems.
# DEFENSE_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://defense.aza.systems
